00:01:20.613 --> 00:01:23.016 align:start size:94% position:6%
I like --
This feels like public access.

00:01:23.016 --> 00:01:24.084 align:start size:94% position:6%
I like it.
-Thank you.

00:01:24.084 --> 00:01:27.187 align:start size:94% position:6%
